{"version":1,"content":"<p>近日，微軟365服務發生的大範圍故障導致全球多個國家和地區的政府機構、法院、醫療機構及企業受到衝擊。管理LibreOffice辦公套件開發的非營利組織「文檔基金會」（The Document Foundation，簡稱TDF）隨後向公共部門提出一連串尖鋭問題，質疑其為何將電子郵件、日曆、文檔協作等關鍵業務高度依賴單一商業雲服務商，卻沒有準備有效的應急預案。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587232.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:44:07.208720+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T06:22:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:37:14.515185+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:37:14.515185+00:00","content_hash":"775f6da8ba9a2373631f5cd2029604a52fbe22c4db98438cd010766945d3a4a2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}